x-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T19:24:23-07:00","id":1420603,"title":"","content":"Thanks for doing this podcast. Lots of fantastic material. (And I see the host of the podcast is like me: a copy of every book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> Strange Lands has a soft spot in my heart as it was one of the ones I was first published in (OK, like... third published in). So seeing its ideas expanded upon is a beautiful thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13194-psyclus","name":"Psyclus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T08:12:17-07:00","id":1420687,"title":"","content":"Frostlands of Fenrilik is NOW AVAILABLE in POD and PDF for Scarred Lands via Onyx Path Publishing's Slarecian Vault at DriveThruRPG.com! Explore the Roof of the World TODAY! <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/328484/Frostlands-of-Fenrilik\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...ds-of-Fenrilik</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T06:18:37-08:00","id":1438730,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psyclus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1416163-frostlands-of-fenrilik-coming-soon?p=1417848#post1417848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Very excited to see more of Fenrilik. Strange Lands was enough to make me hunger for a lot more from this continent!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Quite curious too, due to Strange Lands being something of a blind spot in my Scarred Lands readings - i remember Termana as &quot;that other land, with the Camel demigod&quot; mostly and half the time forget Asherakk even exists. Until you cited the book, i was tempted to ask if Fenrilik was a new setting expansion/retcon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Guess i'll use that kind of ignorance for some kind of unintentionally racist remarks in my hollowfaustian &quot;merchant-prince&quot;, like calling Termana &quot;Camel God Land&quot;, kobolds &quot;pigmy Asaatthi&quot; or other &quot;you called me a what?!&quot; bits. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (Teiro is actually pretty ok with nonhumans in general - a certain Firetusk dwarves elder mindful of his sons {&amp; daughters} back in Hollowfaust might say <b><i>too </i></b>friendly even - an open-mindedness that has led into his getting unknowingly involved with Zathisk rebellion movements due to his efforts to help local minorities get around anti-calastian xenophobic rule)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 03-09-2021, 09:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T06:43:29-08:00","id":1438737,"title":"","content":"pigmy Asaathi hahahaha<br /> <br /> Fenrilik, Asherak and Termana were all introduced in the very first Creature Collection (though granted Fenrilik only had like 2 or 3 monsters to its name). I think the Dragon Lands were mentioned, albeit very indirectly and clearly not by name. Which is sad because I feel that the Dragon Lands need a more &quot;scarnish&quot; continent name ^^ <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Alain%20Giorla\" target=\"_blank\">Slarecian Vault contributions</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5793-haaz","name":"haaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T14:29:53-07:00","id":1440270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1416163-frostlands-of-fenrilik-coming-soon?p=1438730#post1438730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quite curious too, due to Strange Lands being something of a blind spot in my Scarred Lands readings - i remember Termana as &quot;that other land, with the Camel demigod&quot; mostly and half the time forget Asherakk even exists. Until you cited the book, i was tempted to ask if Fenrilik was a new setting expansion/retcon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Asherak is the one with the the Camel demigod.<br /> <br /> Termana is the one with the Bayou Clown, disease elves, and Superior-to-All-of-You Dwarves. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13194-psyclus","name":"Psyclus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T17:51:58-07:00","id":1440304,"title":"",